/-- **BHK Case 5.2.12.4 — the diagonal `(p, q, r) = (1, 9, 10)`.** Speeds
    `w₀ = g, w₁ = 8g, w₂ = 9g, w₃ = 10g, w₄ = sg` with `v₄ = 10/9` (diagonal) and
