  exact bhk_prop11_part6_claim21_lonely2 w hpos hcov6 hsum hdiag hs g q hg hq0 hw0 hw2 t m hbt h0lo h0hi

/-- **Windowed Part 6 — diagonal case `w₃ = w₀ + w₂`** (the `core2` analog of
